                                "sense_id": "83913ab9-92b9-367f-9fe4-7d6fbb1e3797",
                                "text": "\"You never asked us,\" replied Ashleigh, his vexation vanishing, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c3133b4-d6fb-4ccb-80d5-b6884a2cecfb",
                                "sense_id": "83913ab9-92b9-367f-9fe4-7d6fbb1e3797",
                                "text": "\"Ashleigh!\" her mother called. \"Could you bring me a wrap for Slewette's leg from the feed room?\" \"Okay!\" Ashleigh let herself out of Wanderer's stall. She'd check back in a little while to see if the mare had finally eaten anything."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79dbb307-7566-4cd7-ad35-9d6bd9784699",
                                "sense_id": "83913ab9-92b9-367f-9fe4-7d6fbb1e3797",
                                "text": "She simply smiled and squeezed Gina's arm, her fingers lingering, burning her skin. “Thanks.” Gina couldn't speak. She just nodded. She finally released Ashleigh, her hands falling away from her."
                            }
                        ]
